{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cargo cult of amphibians is on its final leg of existence, as their water supply has mysteriously gone dry; they only have one month before starvation. Using your jetpack made by hand, you must climb to the top of their industrial cosmos to convene with your god to restore water to the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you save them?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pressure Based Climbing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/jumpingGif.gif?t=1750832043\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't use the keyboard to move in this game. The mouse, and your eyes, determine your path, and thus, <strong>your success.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/lootinggif.gif?t=1750832043\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sell Scraps, Buy Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/sellinggif.gif?t=1750832043\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jetpack Boost Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic World Based Crosshair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diegetic UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-Linear Level Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag